    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44448" root="&#xA;                        وثق&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الوَثِيقَةُ فِى الأَمْرِ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>The doing the thing firmly;
and taking the sure method,</i> or <i>way;</i> expl. by
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِحْكَامُهُ والأَخْذُ بِالثَِّقَةِ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَثِيقَةٌ</span>
                        <i>A bond,
security,</i> or <i>writing of obligation for the payment
of a debt or the like:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَثَائِقُ</span>. Ex., <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِتْبَةُ الوَثَائِقِ</span>
(Bd, ii. 282,) <i>The mode of writing bonds.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>A
pledge.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَثِيقَةٌ</span>
                        <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُرْجَةٌ</span>, q. v.

